5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I worry about the yard devices. If the system crashes during peak season, freight stops.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I need to see the renewal invoices. I want to know if costs creep up after the contract is signed.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I am looking at support ownership. When things break, who is actually responsible?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to check the upgrade history. I hate when old tools just get patched until they break.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"I am concerned about the people. Who holds the knowledge, and who is leaving?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, if costs creep up, we can't afford downtime. The yard needs stability.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, stability is expensive. I need to see the real price tag, not the brochure.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, if the people leave, the system becomes a black box. That is a risk.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, exactly. If no one knows how it works, we are stuck with bad repairs.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, yes. The system is only as good as the hands that maintain it.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will look at the yard devices and the depot calendar. Those are my priorities.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will examine the renewal invoices and the board minutes. I need the financial truth.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will check support ownership and the administrator retirements. I need to know who is in charge.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will look at the upgrade history and the data lift. I want to see the technical debt.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will investigate the administrator retirements and the depot supervisors. I need to understand the human cost.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,Let's see what the records say. I hope the yard can handle the new system.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I hope the invoices tell the truth. I am tired of surprise bills.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I hope we find a clear owner. Ambiguity is the enemy of progress.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Rin,,I hope the upgrades were done right. I don't want to inherit a mess.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,I hope we respect the people who keep this place running. They are the heart of it.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
