35,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The yard devices are a mess. The 2021 trial failed because we relied on spreadsheets.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I found the invoices. Bundled prices stayed flat, but add-ons climbed every year. That is the trap.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"I found the support ownership. Last winter, nobody was in charge. The system was unowned for two days.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,I found the upgrade history. We skipped three upgrades because testing took too long. That is technical debt.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"I found the truth about our people. Two key administrators are leaving, and the last rollout was ignored by supervisors.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Asuka, if nobody is in charge, the yard stops. I need a system that works even if the office is quiet.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, a system that works is a system we can afford. I will not sign a contract that grows like a weed.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mizuki, cost is one thing. Accountability is another. I need a vendor who owns the outcome, not just the code.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, I agree. But I also need a system that is easy to fix. If it is too complex, we will skip upgrades again.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, complexity is a burden on the people. If the system is hard to learn, the supervisors will ignore it.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Kenji,,The peak season is coming. We cannot afford a cutover that costs two days of paper dispatch.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I will push for a fixed price. If the vendor wants to charge for every little thing, we will lose money.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"I will push for a single point of contact. If the vendor has four teams, we will have four excuses.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"I will push for a system that is easy to test. If we can't test it in a week, we will skip the upgrade.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"I will push for on-site training. If the trainers leave, the knowledge leaves. We need people who stay.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I am ready to vote. I want a system that survives the yard.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,I am ready to vote. I want a system that survives the budget.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I am ready to vote. I want a system that survives the people.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,I am ready to vote. I want a system that survives the time.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,I am ready to vote. I want a system that survives the hands that hold it.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
